---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
---

<Base title="about · Ehsan Ibrahim" description="About Ehsan Ibrahim.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="page">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

    <p class="copy">
      I'm an ECE student at Princeton, minoring in CS. Since I was a kid I've really enjoyed
      building things I can look at and think, "hey, that's pretty cool". It started with legos
      and now it's computers. The part that drives me is understanding the how behind things I'm
      curious about, and building is usually how I like getting there.
    </p>

    <p class="copy">
      I'm interested in hardware engineering and the intersection of hardware and software. Some
      roles I'd be interested in are Computer Architecture, ML systems, RTL design, and
      Performance Engineering. I'm open to more than just that too, feel free to
      <a href="/contact/">reach out</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
